  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089450/description_f40d8e6f-5fec-4ff6-9b69-3353aac635b6.png\" alt=\"Meulti's Backrooms 預覽圖\" width=\"850\" height=\"210\"></p>\n<p>💻 <strong>歡迎來到後室！</strong> 💻</p>\n<p>透過專為《Minecraft》1.20.1 設計的「Meulti's Backrooms」模組包，踏入一個神秘且令人毛骨悚然的世界。本模組包專為恐怖與探索愛好者打造，將你帶入無盡壓抑的房間迷宮中，危險潛伏在每個轉角。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_55a1ed52-26ee-4866-81a3-3f6f895f9f85.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p>🔹&nbsp;<strong>全新恐怖實體：</strong>直面游蕩於後室走廊的全新生物，每種都擁有獨特且令人驚悚的行為模式。<br>🔹 <strong>新方塊與環境：</strong>探索豐富多樣的新方塊，完美捕捉後室的精髓，營造出壓抑且身臨其境的氛圍。<br>🔹 <strong>特色功能：</strong>模組引入獨特機制，進一步強化您冒險旅程中的超自然與神秘元素。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_aee9b1c3-293d-4eb1-8a37-f26445406992.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p>雖然本模組支援單人遊玩，但我們建議 1 至 4 人的團隊合作，以獲得更緊張刺激且具協作性的體驗。人數越多，越嚇人！😱</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_1bd2ddf8-d2a3-4c78-a00f-0683a3cd054d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>本模組包含可能引起不安的元素，特別是在黑暗環境中，可能會讓敏感的玩家感到不適或焦慮。請謹慎遊玩！🌑</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_97b51dba-57c6-4cc3-8927-d27bb86a9d39.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p>本模組正在積極開發中，歡迎追蹤我們的進度、分享您的想法，並加入我們的 Discord 社群：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/Xrn4ewcwFD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 連結</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_7a935d7b-7a2c-4175-b868-322e7de94350.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<h3><strong>第一階段：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>第 0 層</li>\n<li>第 3 層</li>\n<li>第 37 層</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>第二階段：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>第 0 層</li>\n<li>第 1 層</li>\n<li>第 4 層</li>\n<li>第 26 層</li>\n<li>第 8 層</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_a8d5da61-f10c-49a8-b088-032404f88bdb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<h2><strong>嚎叫者：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_aea3157c-7aff-44a8-a16c-1972c57aa833.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><strong style=\"display:inline !important\">微笑者：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_c0e4db16-6713-4a8e-b933-2f31ae83c8ad.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"264\" height=\"256\"></strong></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>死鼠：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_c27caca6-d92e-4844-8112-47dee6e4856f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>剝皮者：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_b530d718-ac2e-4219-a809-8dafade6aa0d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>狂歡者：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1099870/description_6d235f54-f7fa-4db4-b9ac-dad0747c84d1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想要購買伺服器嗎？</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>為了支持我並與朋友一起遊玩，您可以從&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmodpackmeultisbackrooms\" rel=\"nofollow\">WabbaNode</a> 購買伺服器！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmodpackmeultisbackrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span st